Mechanism: fixed-size WheelIntent retains a pending logical-pixel target across input events within one solved-layout epoch. Navigation and Tasks use it directly; scoped Chat State embeds it. Successful solve_ui completion explicitly retires all three pending bursts, including cache hits; scope changes/invalid binds and explicit Chat Send retire that Chat burst, existing swarm reset retires Tasks. New events after layout seed from actual clamped geometry; manual loading/reflow intent remains retained until a real gesture changes it. No float-equality epoch guessing, idle callbacks or protocol changes.
Optimization: wheel handlers request redraw only when visual offset/follow state changes. Tasks continuation reads occur only for downward gestures within28px of bottom; clamped boundary gestures may still request retained older pages without an immediate redundant redraw.
